  "description": "This library is a high-performance .NET library for processing multiple XLIFF format variants (XLIFF 1.2, XLIFF 2.2, MQXLIFF, TXLF, XLF) using efficient string operations rather than XML DOM manipulation. The library enables seamless parsing, conversion, and generation of XLIFF documents with support for complex inline tags, translation units, and file groups. Designed for localization specialists and developers working with translation workflows, it provides a unified API to handle different XLIFF dialects while maintaining high performance and low memory usage. Easily read, modify, and write XLIFF files with full support for source/target languages, metadata, and document structure preservation.",
